              <flipboard active-id='1' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='EV Market Intelligence Dashboard&#10;&#10;This interactive dashboard combines EV sales, customer ratings, battery technology distribution, and average driving range into a single view. Users can explore the available data to compare vehicle categories, examine battery technologies, and evaluate manufacturer performance. The combined visualizations support data-driven decision-making, help identify potential market opportunities, and provide a foundation for further research into electric vehicle adoption and industry development.' captured-sheet='EV Market Analysis' id='1'>
